      "writtenOn": "2023-08-30T04:11:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "OK so IIUC, this makes it a link against a lib that\u0027s not included, and therefore anybody who links against `connectivity-net-module-utils-bpf` is now required to have `net-utils-device-common-struct` as a static lib in their final artefact, otherwise they\u0027ll have a link error ?\n\nThe question here is : what version are we sure to get here ? If we might get a future or past version of this library I think this is dangerous.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 37,
        "startChar": 11,
